          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "這……是什麼地方……這些石像……",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "它們……全都栩栩如生……",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "薩卡茲種族的石像？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "text": "很頑強，“博士”，我很敬佩你。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "……",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
          "text": "你醒了？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
          "text": "如此孱弱的身體，是如何跟隨我來到這裡的？我嘗試檢查你的身體，但是一無所獲。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
          "text": "不……也不是一無所獲。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
          "text": "你的構造……很特殊。和我所知的所有樣本都不一樣，我想要研究你。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
          "text": "“仔細研究”。可惜這裡很久之前就被首領廢棄了，實驗設施不完整，我不想損壞你這麼珍貴的實驗體。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
          "text": "還是得帶回倫蒂尼姆嗎？可是特雷西斯好像對你格外關注……",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "阿米婭……",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
          "text": "你瞧啊，“博士”——她正看著什麼呢？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
          "text": "她在顫抖呢。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你對她做了什麼？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
          "text": "“魔王賜予偉大的幻境”。小兔子只是稍——微感受了一下她自己的力量。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我們沒必要互相敵對，你尋求知識？羅德島也有。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
              "text": "可笑的拉攏。",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "你希望交換什麼？我們可以談談。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
              "text": "無意義的談判。",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "停下，否則我會讓你溺死在岩漿之中。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
              "text": "帶著顫抖的威脅。",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
          "text": "瞧你那一籌莫展、想抓住一切可能的樣子，看上去真令人心疼。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
          "text": "你的幹員不在你的身邊，你的指揮派不上用場，現在，就連你所侍奉的“魔王”都在離你而去。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
          "text": "你還能做得到什麼呢？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
          "text": "我總是請教首領，權柄為何總被庸人把持？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
          "text": "這些被歷史遺忘的魔王，給我們帶來的，除了顛沛流離的生活，還有什麼呢？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
          "text": "而你，“博士”，你會是這次苦難的源頭之一嗎？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你提出了很多疑問，但這裡不是個適合探討的地方。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "只要你解除阿米婭身上的巫術，我願意盡力回答你。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我有和你相同的困惑，但傷害阿米婭無法帶來答案。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
          "text": "我不討厭你的智慧。但說實在話，聰明人從來都不缺。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
          "text": "任何東西都換不來這次機會，都換不來我們數千年的追尋。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
          "text": "那麼……既然她能把王冠強行戴上這個小兔子的腦袋——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
          "text": "它也應該能被抽取出來才對呀。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你想偷走阿米婭的王冠！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
          "text": "偷？不不，這頂王冠不是個遺落在戰場上的鐵環，任人拾取。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
          "text": "你不會明白。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
          "text": "瞧瞧，這是什麼，一枚——石頭？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
          "text": "令人感動，但我必須提醒你，擋在她面前毫無意義。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
          "text": "既然你如此執著，我想到了一個更好的辦法來處理你，“博士”。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
          "text": "也許你隱藏在兜帽下的腦袋裡，同樣也藏著不少有助於我們實驗的秘密。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
          "text": "就這樣，不要抵抗我的巫術。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
          "text": "向我分享你的記憶——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "從我的腦子裡滾出去！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
          "text": "……什麼？什麼力量能這麼徹底地排斥赦罪師的……",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
          "text": "是“魔王”……？可她的精神應該受到了巨大的限制……",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "*古老的薩卡茲語*。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "阿米婭！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
          "text": "誕生自眾魂的枷鎖可沒那麼容易掙脫，她還停留在眾魂之間。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
          "text": "她在潛意識中依然選擇保護你，呵。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
          "text": "……等等。不僅如此？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
          "text": "她和王冠的聯繫在加深……？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "阿米婭！醒醒！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
          "text": "啊，如此濃烈的情感。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
          "text": "特蕾西婭當年會選擇你，好像不完全是走投無路，小兔子。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
          "text": "既然如此，那我們乾脆略過無聊的前奏吧。希望你的小腦袋瓜不會因此毀掉，那樣就太可惜了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
          "text": "赦罪師在這座洞窟裡留下的，可不止是雕像。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
          "text": "*薩卡茲咒語*。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "阿米婭！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你答應過我——",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "拒絕那個聲音！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
          "text": "呿——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
          "text": "博士，你的行動太過魯莽，如果不是我遇到了——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "text": "小心。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "text": "血魔的法術……你們對自己的……“血脈”擺弄到了何種地步？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "text": "無法想像，你們是使徒閃靈的血親。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "text": "那樣一位優異之人，卻要時刻為你們的污穢而懺悔。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
          "text": "咳，咳咳——女妖之主。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
          "text": "虧你們能進入這裡。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
          "text": "聽說如今的女妖之主相當叛逆，我真該再小心一點。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
          "text": "……你比我們預期的更危險。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
          "text": "沒有審訊的餘力，情況緊急，殺了她，離開。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "text": "我明白。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
          "text": "喔，這就是如今的女妖之主？“王庭喪鐘”？確實了得，這些咒文的精細程度不亞於你的英雄母親。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
          "text": "可，你知道嗎？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "薩盧斯",
          "text": "這樣精巧的符文——精巧的源石技藝，絕非薩卡茲最本初的心態。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "text": "——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "text": "阿斯卡綸！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "——！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "text": "博士。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "text": "我們已經離開了洞窟，阿斯卡綸在勘察附近的地形。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "text": "你的右臂橈骨被折斷了，我正在為你做基本的處理。我不是醫療幹員，只能做到這個程度。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "阿米婭的情況怎麼樣？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "text": "……她還在昏迷。“受困於眾魂”，儘管赦罪師表露出類似含義，但……",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "text": "至少，她性命無礙。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "text": "我理解阿斯卡綸對你行事的不滿，博士。她所擔心的，不僅有你的安全。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "text": "但你確實為我們爭取了時間，如果不是你的拖延，赦罪師恐怕已經帶著阿米婭躲藏進了倫蒂尼姆的高牆之後。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "那個赦罪師呢？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "text": "讓她逃了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "text": "土石，鮮血，還有……女妖之嘯。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "text": "這就是赦罪師所期望的薩卡茲的模樣？執迷於……所謂的血統和巫術？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "他們的目標是“魔王”。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我們必須盡快轉告凱爾希和閃靈。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "text": "……等等。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "text": "這些氤氳的水氣……",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "text": "……不可能。博士，小心點。我們未必離開了敵人的陷阱。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "怎麼了？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "很少見你的臉色變化。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "text": "這裡……不是維多利亞。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "text": "這裡是女妖的河谷。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
